# The 4007 Series Hyper Coupler (8mm Round Bore to 8mm REX Bore) as goBILDA sells it: the coupler and its pinch bolts.
# Each is taken out of goBILDA's model of the whole of it (see 'motion/coupler_hyper_8mm_8mmREX_model' in partcad.yaml),
# so each is where that model has it, and all of them are placed at the origin.
links:
  - part: motion/coupler_hyper_8mm_8mmREX_coupler
    name: coupler
  - part: motion/coupler_hyper_8mm_8mmREX_pinch_bolts
    name: pinch-bolts
